  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/that-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime-gui-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fthat-time-i-got-reincarnated-as-a-slime-gui-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Kesselspacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/documentation/website_vector.svg\" alt=\"官方網站\"></a></p>\n<h1>概述</h1>\n<p>來自深受喜愛的動畫／漫畫／輕小說《關於我轉生變成史萊姆這檔事》。享受全面改版的 Minecraft 介面體驗，收錄所有受歡迎的角色，當然還有主角利姆魯·特恩佩斯特。</p>\n<h2>推薦整合包</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/tensura-suraimu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>TenSura（關於我轉生變成史萊姆這檔事）</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h1>預覽圖 - 更多內容請查看圖庫！</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/IDei5Bkh/images/f96a0629f10a28b05aa13143c26892d42d574057.png\" alt=\"大型箱子選單\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/IDei5Bkh/images/fd4afd36b5854e7814d98af992199902ef2b28f5.png\" alt=\"鐵砧選單\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/IDei5Bkh/images/0c4fadb408b333e20964eeab5cd98cb0ecf16b2b.png\" alt=\"鍛造台選單\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/39e1d151-f787-4346-9014-f14dc996f94e.webp\" alt=\"Bisecthosting 贊助橫幅\"></a></p>\n<h3>資源包注意事項</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>如果您是 YouTube 創作者或內容製作者並使用此資源包，請在影片描述中加入連結指向本頁面，讓其他人知道您使用的資源包。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>不允許在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上重新上傳此資源包或任何修改版本，這也包括重新分發至任何其他網站。</strong>（<em>除非獲得我的明確許可</em>）</li>\n</ul>",
